{"result":"{
  "id": "18194",
  "key": "SFCC-112",
  "summary": "Recommendations – Einstein Configuration & Zone Setup",
  "description": "**As a** Developer, \n\n**I want** Einstein Recommendations provisioned in Business Manager and recommendation zones created for each required surface, \n\n**so that** the PWA carousel components have a valid zone to connect to when built.\n\n----\n\nThis story covers provisioning only: enabling Einstein Recommendations in BM and creating named recommendation zones for Recommended for You (PDP, Cart, Mini-Bag, My Account, Search) and More from Category (PDP). It does not include configuration of recommendation logic, rules-based fallback, or AI/rules toggling — Zimmermann will configure those post-handover. Complete the Look and Shop the Edit are manually merchandised and are not covered here.",
